A fake investment is a fraudulent scheme where scammers convince people to invest money by promising high or guaranteed returns. The investment is not genuine, and the victim's money is usually stolen instead of being invested.
Example Scenario: AI Smart Glasses at an ATM (Hypothetical)
Title: ATM PIN Capture Using AI Smart Glasses
Scenario
A fraudster stands in the ATM queue wearing ordinary-looking AI smart glasses.
While waiting, the glasses discreetly record the customer entering their ATM PIN.
The built-in AI enhances the video to identify the PIN entered on the keypad.
The glasses also capture the card number if the customer briefly exposes the card while inserting or removing it.
Later, the fraudster uses the captured information together with a cloned card or other stolen card data to attempt fraudulent ATM withdrawals or purchases.
